                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hey. As you can see, I've played this game... like a lot. In all honesty, there's a LOT of bugs in this game, and i'm sure you'll find them when you play. BUT, the developers are very passionate about this project and are working hard to get all these bugs fixed for the full release. Make sure you join the discord and point out any bugs that you find! Definitely recommend this game for anyone who enjoys Smash, Rivals, Brawlhalla, or any other of these smash-like platform fighter games. The game is good now and only getting better with updates!",
